<title>USA: Fortress Group says ends deal with Woodside.</title>
<headline>Fortress Group says ends deal with Woodside.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fortress Group Inc said Tuesday it is not proceeding with its previously announced plan to acquire Woodside Homes Corp, a regional homebuilding company operating in Utah, Nevada, and Arizona.</p>
<p>The company, a builder of single and multi-family homes, did not disclose further details.</p>
<p>Fortress Group announced on April 15 it had reached a definitive agreement to purchase Woodside Homes for a total of $126.5 million.</p>
</text>
